(ABSTRACT:) Tj
0 -15 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(Kinship terminologies embody the social structural logic and reciprocal) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(obligations of human societies. This paper presents the first exhaustive) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(ethnolinguistic classification of Tangkhul kinship terminology,) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(encompassing 68 consanguineal and affinal terms. We demonstrate that) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(Tangkhul exhibits a bifurcate merging system of the Omaha subtype,) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(reflecting strict patrilineal clan organization \(Shang\) and asymmetrical) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 9 Tf
(cross-cousin marriage rules.) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 8 Tf
( ) Tj
0 -12 Td
/F2 10 Tf
(Keywords: Kinship, Omaha Type, Shang, Consanguinity, Ethnolinguistics, Thirumalai) Tj
0 -14 Td
